                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2024-24791\nSeverity: high\nPackage: stdlib\nVersion: go1.20.7\nFix Version: 1.21.12,1.22.5\nType: go-module\nLocation: /opt/bitnami/redis-exporter/bin/redis_exporter\nData Namespace: nvd:cpe\nLink: [CVE-2024-24791](https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2024-24791)",
