            {
              "id": "CVE-2024-45341-stdlib",
              "name": "GoModuleMatcherCpeMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2024-45341 medium vulnerability for stdlib package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "A certificate with a URI which has a IPv6 address with a zone ID may incorrectly satisfy a URI name constraint that applies to the certificate chain. Certificates containing URIs are not permitted in the web PKI, so this only affects users of private PKIs which make use of URIs."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/anchore/grype",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2024-45341\nSeverity: medium\nPackage: stdlib\nVersion: go1.20.7\nFix Version: 1.22.11,1.23.5,1.24.0-rc.2\nType: go-module\nLocation: /opt/bitnami/redis-exporter/bin/redis_exporter\nData Namespace: nvd:cpe\nLink: [CVE-2024-45341](https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2024-45341)",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2024-45341**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| medium  | stdlib  | go1.20.7  | 1.22.11,1.23.5,1.24.0-rc.2  | go-module  | /opt/bitnami/redis-exporter/bin/redis_exporter  | nvd:cpe  | [CVE-2024-45341](https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2024-45341)  |\n"
